        {
          "ref": "l-m-02",
          "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
          "quote": "participants were randomized to placebo (n = 26) or metformin (n = 27) treatment during 12 weeks of AET",
          "quotePrefix": "). In a double-blinded fashion, ",
          "quoteSuffix": ". Independent of treatment, AET ",
